# Gateway Journey — progressive Focus 10 -> 12 -> 15 -> 21 -> return — ~40 min
# Goal: a single continuous Monroe-style journey that walks UP through the Gateway
#       levels (the "t-seqall" concept), transitioning the binaural layer stack between
#       each threshold, then descends back toward Focus 10 and a gentle soft close.
# Driver: BINAURAL — HEADPHONES REQUIRED. beat = freq_r - carrier, held FIXED per layer
#         (guidelines 5a). Levels are ADD/REMOVE layers, not beat glides: introduce a
#         layer by fading its channel VOLUME in, remove it by fading it out (~30-60 s).
#
# Monroe patent upgrade (US 5,356,368): + phased PINK-NOISE bed (ch14, wave 5, 6 s L<->R
#   pan LFO, -18 dB under the theta base) spanning the whole 40-min arc. NO septon here —
#   the 13-channel ladder leaves no channel budget. Carrier ladder (F10->F12->F15->F21)
#   UNCHANGED; LED stays 4 Hz (beta 16.2 stays AUDIO-ONLY). See monroe_patents_guide.md.
#
# Measured layer map (carrier[beat Hz], from gateway_focus_construction_guide.md):
#   F10  100[1.5] · 200[4.0] · 250[4.0] · 300[4.0]
#   F12  F10 + 400[10.0] · 500[10.1] · 600[4.8]                (adds alpha ~10)
#   F15  F10 + 500[7.05] · 630[7.1] · 750[7.0]                 (adds upper-theta 7)
#   F21  (drop 100 delta) 200/250/300[4.0] + 600/750/900[16.2] (adds BETA 16)
#
# Channel map (one channel per layer, pan 0, sine):
#   ch1  100/101.5 (1.5)   ch2 200/204 (4.0)  ch3 250/254 (4.0)  ch4 300/304 (4.0)   [F10 base]
#   ch5  400/410 (10.0)    ch6 500/510.1 (10.1)  ch7 600/604.8 (4.8)                  [F12 alpha]
#   ch8  500/507.05 (7.05) ch9 630/637.1 (7.1)   ch10 750/757 (7.0)                   [F15 theta-7]
#   ch11 600/616.2 (16.2)  ch12 750/766.2 (16.2) ch13 900/916.2 (16.2)                [F21 BETA]
#   ch14 pink-noise bed (wave 5, pan LFO 6 s, -18 dB, whole arc)                        [Monroe bed]
#
# LED (guidelines 4): flicker held at a STEADY, SAFE 4 Hz THETA for the ENTIRE journey —
#   it NEVER tracks the alpha (10), theta-7, or (critically) the F21 BETA 16.2 Hz beats.
#   16 Hz is inside the 15-25 Hz photosensitive-seizure band; the LED stays 4 Hz always.
#   Dim violet (<= 26%), ramp-in 15 s, gentle breathing LFO, multi-minute fade-out.
#   Carriers 100..900 Hz (< 1000); every binaural offset <= 16.2 Hz (< 35).
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a segment
# BEGINS; its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row over the gap.

# --- Prep / fade-in (00:00-03:00): a calm 100[1.5] delta tone; vol + light fade in ---
0 4 50 >0 120 60 200 15   # LED 4 Hz theta, dim violet, brightness ramps 0->18% over 15 s
A 0 100 0 >0 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 100[1.5] delta: vol fades 0->60 over 60 s; sine
A 0 200 ~-100:100:6000 >0 0 14 0 5   # pink bed ch14: 6 s L<->R pan, vol fades 0->8 over 60 s (wave 5)
S 3000 default 20 "Relax and let the body settle. We will travel inward, one gentle threshold at a time."
15000 4 50 18 120 60 200 15   # brightness reaches 18% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 4 50 ~10:22:12000 120 60 200 15   # gentle breathing LFO: brightness sine 10<->22% over 12 s
A 60000 100 0 60 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 vol reaches 60; delta anchor held
A 60000 200 ~-100:100:6000 8 0 14 0 5   # pink bed reaches -18 dB steady (held through the arc)

# --- FOCUS 10 (03:00-10:00): add 200/250/300[4.0] theta base ---
A 180000 200 0 >0 0 2 204 7  # ch2 fades in 0->60 over 60 s
A 240000 200 0 60 0 2 204 7
A 180000 250 0 >0 0 3 254 7  # ch3 fades in
A 240000 250 0 60 0 3 254 7
A 180000 300 0 >0 0 4 304 7  # ch4 fades in
A 240000 300 0 60 0 4 304 7
S 180000 default 20 "Entering Focus 10. The body is asleep, the mind awake, still, and clear."

# --- FOCUS 12 (10:00-18:00): add alpha 400[10] + 500[10.1] + 600[4.8] (AUDIO-ONLY; LED stays 4 Hz) ---
A 600000 400 0 >0 0 5 410 7  # ch5 alpha fades in 0->35 over 60 s (quieter than the theta base)
A 660000 400 0 35 0 5 410 7
A 600000 500 0 >0 0 6 510.1 7  # ch6 alpha fades in
A 660000 500 0 35 0 6 510.1 7
A 600000 600 0 >0 0 7 604.8 7  # ch7 4.8 Hz fades in
A 660000 600 0 45 0 7 604.8 7
S 600000 default 20 "Expanding now into Focus 12 — awareness opening wide, beyond the body."

# --- FOCUS 15 (18:00-26:00): remove the alpha, add upper-theta 500[7.05]/630[7.1]/750[7.0] ---
A 1080000 400 0 >35 0 5 410 7  # ch5 alpha fades out 35->0 over 60 s
A 1140000 400 0 0 0 5 410 7
A 1080000 500 0 >35 0 6 510.1 7  # ch6 alpha fades out
A 1140000 500 0 0 0 6 510.1 7
A 1080000 600 0 >45 0 7 604.8 7  # ch7 fades out
A 1140000 600 0 0 0 7 604.8 7
A 1080000 500 0 >0 0 8 507.05 7  # ch8 7.05 Hz fades in 0->40
A 1140000 500 0 40 0 8 507.05 7
A 1080000 630 0 >0 0 9 637.1 7  # ch9 7.1 Hz fades in
A 1140000 630 0 40 0 9 637.1 7
A 1080000 750 0 >0 0 10 757 7  # ch10 7.0 Hz fades in
A 1140000 750 0 40 0 10 757 7
S 1080000 default 20 "Into Focus 15, where time falls away. No past, no future, only this open stillness."

# --- FOCUS 21 (26:00-34:00): drop 100 delta + the theta-7 set; add BETA 600/750/900[16.2] ---
#     WARNING: 16.2 Hz is AUDIO-ONLY — the LED NEVER strobes at 16 Hz; it holds 4 Hz theta.
A 1560000 100 0 >60 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 delta fades out 60->0 over 60 s (leaving F10 anchor behind)
A 1620000 100 0 0 0 1 101.5 7
A 1560000 500 0 >40 0 8 507.05 7  # ch8 theta-7 fades out
A 1620000 500 0 0 0 8 507.05 7
A 1560000 630 0 >40 0 9 637.1 7  # ch9 fades out
A 1620000 630 0 0 0 9 637.1 7
A 1560000 750 0 >40 0 10 757 7  # ch10 fades out
A 1620000 750 0 0 0 10 757 7
A 1560000 600 0 >0 0 11 616.2 7  # ch11 BETA 16.2 fades in 0->35 (audio-only, quiet)
A 1620000 600 0 35 0 11 616.2 7
A 1560000 750 0 >0 0 12 766.2 7  # ch12 BETA 16.2 fades in
A 1620000 750 0 35 0 12 766.2 7
A 1560000 900 0 >0 0 13 916.2 7  # ch13 BETA 16.2 fades in
A 1620000 900 0 35 0 13 916.2 7
S 1560000 default 20 "Focus 21 — the bridge, the far edge of the known. The 200, 250, and 300 theta layers hold you steady."
S 1800000 default 20 "Rest at the bridge. Reach out gently, then let yourself begin to return."

# --- RETURN (34:00-40:00): descend back toward Focus 10, gentle wake, then soft fade ---
A 2040000 200 ~-100:100:6000 >8 0 14 0 5 # pink bed begins its slow fade-out across the return
A 2040000 600 0 >35 0 11 616.2 7  # ch11 beta fades out 35->0 over 2 min
A 2160000 600 0 0 0 11 616.2 7
A 2040000 750 0 >35 0 12 766.2 7  # ch12 beta fades out
A 2160000 750 0 0 0 12 766.2 7
A 2040000 900 0 >35 0 13 916.2 7  # ch13 beta fades out
A 2160000 900 0 0 0 13 916.2 7
A 2040000 100 0 >0 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 delta anchor fades back in 0->60 (settling toward F10)
A 2160000 100 0 60 0 1 101.5 7
S 2040000 default 20 "Descending now, step by step, back through the levels toward the familiar."

# --- Soft close (38:00-40:00): the F10 base + brightness fade to zero, gentle and unhurried ---
A 2280000 100 0 >60 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 fades 60->0 over 2 min
A 2400000 100 0 0 0 1 101.5 7
A 2280000 200 0 >60 0 2 204 7  # ch2 fades out
A 2400000 200 0 0 0 2 204 7
A 2280000 250 0 >60 0 3 254 7  # ch3 fades out
A 2400000 250 0 0 0 3 254 7
A 2280000 300 0 >60 0 4 304 7  # ch4 fades out
A 2400000 300 0 0 0 4 304 7
2280000 4 50 >18 120 60 200 15   # brightness fades 18->0 over 2 min (>=15 s), never abrupt
S 2280000 default 20 "Coming all the way back to the room now, calm, whole, and refreshed."
A 2400000 200 ~-100:100:6000 0 0 14 0 5 # pink bed reaches 0 at session end
2400000 4 50 0 120 60 200 15   # end: brightness 0

S 2400000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 2410000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 2420000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 2430000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
